mapping "V6012.1" source="V6012" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6012 = Swedish ICD-10-SE 7-character extension of V60.x parent: occupant of heavy
        transport vehicle injured in collision with pedestrian or animal, with a 7th-character activity
        context (e.g. paid work, leisure, sleep). Target SNOMED CT 437738 = SNOMED CT 214640008, the most
        specific standard concept from the Athena crosswalk of the base V60.x parent. The
        activity-context suffix has no SNOMED CT representation; the target fully subsumes the
        accident/injury axis but loses the occupant role, vehicle type, collision partner, and activity
        dimensions. broader: target is a legitimate ancestor fully containing the accident event;
        multiple levels of specificity lost justify the low tier.
        """
}
